              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-8">
                <num>8</num>
                <heading>Subsection 372H(2)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the subsection, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <content>
                    <p>Requirements</p>
                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>A constitutional corporation must not, in the course of carrying out, or carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease such a building unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to the unit.</p>
                    </content>
                    <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-20" marker="20">
                      <content>
                        <p>Note 1:	For <b><i>functional fibre</i></b><b><i>-</i></b><b><i>ready facility</i></b>, see <ref href="#sec-372W">section 372W</ref>.</p>
