                      </content>
                    </authorialNote>
                    <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-22" marker="22">
                      <content>
                        <p>Note 3:	For exemptions, see <ref href="#sec-372K">section 372K</ref>.</p>
                      </content>
                    </authorialNote>
                  </subsection>
