                    <num>3</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>If such a building unit is in a Territory, a person (other than a constitutional corporation) must not, in the course of carrying out, or carrying out an element of, the project, sell or lease the unit unless a functional fibre-ready facility is installed in proximity to the unit.</p>
                    </content>
